		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant, pirate-made spider- construct made of a variety of blades. Eight feet long.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 scimitar +4 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cannot be disarmed</strong>. </p><p></p><p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Weapon Thief</strong>. If spider disarms a creature, absorbs weapon into body, can use it to attack.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
